!user_projects/empty.txt
# Upstream ignores all of user_projects/ because it is scratch space there. In
# this fork these two ARE the source of truth, so re-include them -- otherwise
# `git add user_projects/antigen_presentation` is refused and the whole tree has
# to be force-added, which is how 9 .DS_Store files got committed past the rule
# on line 3. Negating the directories lets git descend; the general rules above
# (.DS_Store, *.o, ...) still apply to their contents.
!user_projects/antigen_presentation/
!user_projects/antigen_presentation_htan_singlecell/

project*
